{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/355656-some-new-demonic-form-powers","id":355656,"title":"Some new Demonic Form powers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-31T04:55:27-08:00","id":355656,"title":"Some new Demonic Form powers","content":"EDIT: changed the &quot;Signal&quot; Process.<br /> <br /> You may have noticed that I gave two options for benefits on some abilities. You choose the one that fits your desired power level or come up with your own bonus. Any feedback on these ideas is welcome.<br /> <br /> MODIFICATIONS<br /> <br /> Untiring Body: Angels can be sent on missions that require truly superhuman levels of physical endurance, such as chasing down supernatural beings with extreme speed. Angels with this ability often caught their quarries due to attrition, rather than sheer speed. Appearance: the demon may have tubes or pipes that belch smoke or some other substance, invoking the image of motorcycles and other vehicles. He may have small crystalline batteries of aetheric energy on his back or another part of the body. He may have exposed rivulets, gears and pumps that work tirelessly. System: the demon can exert himself physically a lot longer. Give the demon +3 to Stamina or 8 Again to Stamina.<br /> <br /> Hypnotic Frequency: sometimes, destructive power is not ideal or even counterproductive. Angels with this power use it when diplomacy is necessary. Appearance: the demon may have something resembling an old fashioned tape recorder installed on his throat, complete with exposed wheels and dials. He may have a series of precisely calculated blinking lights on his eyes or forehead. System: the demon can sway people more easily despite the appearance of this modification. Give the demon +3 or 8 Again on Manipulation. Also give a mild emotion suppressing effect that prevents those who see the technological source of the modification from considering it abnormal during most circumstances.<br /> <br /> Repairing Touch: Angels with this power were sent to save the lives of those rare individuals that were too valuable to lose. Appearance: the demon may have gleaming scalpels, dripping hypodermic needles, whirring drills and other surgical/medical apparatus built into his hands. He has all the necessary tools to treat most wounds, and rolls Dexterity + Medicine (first aid) or Intelligence + Medicine (intensive care), with a +3 bonus for the latter. You cannot heal aggravated damage.<br /> <br /> TECHNOLOGIES<br /> <br /> Molecular Insight: you can gather information about the structure and purpose of both mundane and supernatural objects. Appearance: the demon\u2019s eyes may stretch into telescopic stalks or emit scanning lights. His hands may produce veins with microscopic cameras that infiltrate the object and then come out without damaging it. System: spend 1 aether and roll Wits + Crafts + Primum. Success tells you the approximate age, general composition, most likely function and any other information deemed acceptable by the ST. Exceptional Success gives you more detailed/precise/useful information.<br /> <br /> PROPULSIONS<br /> <br /> Hydrodynamic: you can breathe underwater and swim faster, as well as ignore most conditions of the deep sea. Appearance: metallic fins, masks with tubes and thruster engines. System: you can remain underwater indefinitely and you gain +3 or 8 Again to Athletics rolls for swimming (no Defense bonus). You also gain 5 Speed.<br /> <br /> Excavation: you can dig through the ground at incredible speeds. Appearance: drills, melting lasers and rock-shattering sonic blasts. System: you can burrow underground with +3 or 8 Again to Athletics rolls while within the earth (no Defense bonus). You also gain 5 Speed.<br /> <br /> PROCESSES<br /> <br /> The Signal: you have a minor version of the God-Machine\u2019s ability to summon strange entities from other planes of existence. These allies should last for a scene. Appearance: the demon\u2019s ribcage or forehead splits open, revealing a portal that can produce different cosmetic effects, such as sound, light and smoke. System: you can summon servants which some demons like to call Imps. Roll Manipulation + Primum and spend 3 Aether + 1 willpower. The Action is instant. Success summons a Rank 2 Imp and Exceptional Success summons a Rank 3 Imp. You are encouraged to come up with the most interesting creatures you can, from pulsating slime pods that float through gas sacs to crawling musical instruments of glass and blood. All Imps are automatically considered to have a Numen that makes them seem like something mundane.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 12-31-2014, 12:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-31T08:45:51-08:00","id":355776,"title":"","content":"Did you read the players guide? Your propulsiond and technologies are covered there. I personally think that &quot;untiring body&quot; is over kill since mist star increasing demon abilities just give a +2 to. attributes. <br /> The process should be cleaned up, with &quot;imps&quot;. At at least some example for how long a role can take/ how many success instead of just beung an instant whim of the st. I'd remove the but about exacting a price and just make it flat out aether. But honestly. An extended action demonic form power? That compromise role would start getting insane.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-31T09:28:21-08:00","id":355813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>miss_minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/355656-some-new-demonic-form-powers?p=355776#post355776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Did you read the players guide? Your propulsiond and technologies are covered there. I personally think that &quot;untiring body&quot; is over kill since mist star increasing demon abilities just give a +2 to. attributes.<br /> The process should be cleaned up, with &quot;imps&quot;. At at least some example for how long a role can take/ how many success instead of just beung an instant whim of the st. I'd remove the but about exacting a price and just make it flat out aether. But honestly. An extended action demonic form power? That compromise role would start getting insane.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I didn't, sorry. I changed the description of The Signal accordingly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/c